<span class="cs-line cmt"># HellaSwag 55.9 → 57.9 ↑</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># PIQA     73.3 → 74.4  ↑</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># SciQ     79.5 → 82.0  ↑</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># WinoGrande 57.0→ 60.2 ↑</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># COPA     76.0 → 73.0  ↓</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># OBQA     33.8 → 33.6  ≈</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># RACE     34.3 → 33.4  ↓</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># &gt;&lt;former wins on 7/9 accuracy tasks</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># and both perplexity metrics, with:</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p"><span class="cmt">#  −2.5% FLOPs, −10.9% KV cache</span></span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># MoE results (mixed NLU, better PPL):</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt"># LAMBADA PPL: 7.78 → 7.45  ↓</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt"># WikiText:   16.36 → 15.98  ↓</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt"># FLOPs: −4.6%, KV: −10.9%</span></span>
      </pre>
    </div>

  </div>
